{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2023-04-18 06:30:00', 'title': "LINDE NAMED ONE OF THE 2023 WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES", 'text': "WOKING, UK / ACCESSWIRE / APRIL 18, 2023 / LINDE (NYSE:LIN) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED AS ONE OF THE 2023 WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES BY ETHISPHERE, ITS THIRD CONSECUTIVE YEAR OF INCLUSION ON THE LIST. LINDE IS ONE OF ONLY TWO COMPANIES IN THE CHEMICALS SECTOR TO BE INCLUDED IN ETHISPHERE'S LIST OF GLOBAL LEADERS FOR ETHICAL BUSINESS PRACTICES."}